#. command help: didact session zero
#: didact/commands/profile.py
msgid ""
"Ask the player each question (the system pack's own come first), then save the\n"
"answers: `didact campaign profile role=gm tone='grim but hopeful' lines+=spiders`.\n"
"Every brief carries the profile afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Kysy pelaajalta jokainen kysymys (systeemipaketin omat ensin) ja tallenna sitten\n"
"vastaukset: `didact campaign profile role=gm tone='grim but hopeful' lines+=spiders`.\n"
"Jokainen katsaus sisältää profiilin sen jälkeen."

#. command help: didact ask
#: didact/commands/oracles.py
msgid ""
"Ask what the fiction can't answer yet. The answer is numbered (#o12), logged with its\n"
"rolls, and during a session written to the journal. Then say what it means:\n"
"`didact interpret o12 '…'`. The oracle is the campaign's (`campaign set oracle=…`),\n"
"else the one a pack brings, else Didact's own yes/no oracle."
msgstr ""
"Kysy se, mihin fiktio ei vielä vastaa. Vastaus numeroidaan (#o12), kirjataan\n"
"heittoineen ja pelikerran aikana päiväkirjaan. Kerro sitten, mitä se tarkoittaa:\n"
"`didact interpret o12 '…'`. Oraakkeli on kampanjan oma (`campaign set oracle=…`),\n"
"muuten paketin tuoma, muuten Didactin oma kyllä/ei-oraakkeli."

